data: {"id": "c568668e54534321-thinking-parallel_evidence-1358", "run_id": "c568668e54534321", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实与证据分析\n\n### 1. Pod 身份与生命周期\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-v16/workload`, UID: `12605456-2339-4da9-9d4d-5523d1196b72`, 节点 `node2`, Pod IP: `172.16.104.33`\n- **Phase**: `Running`，但 **Ready = False** (`containers with unready status: [app]`)\n- **容器 `app`**: State=Running, Restart Count=0, Ready=False — **未发生 CrashLoopBackOff**\n\n### 2. Readiness Probe 配置与实际行为冲突（根因核心）\n\n**Probe 配置（来自 describe 和 YAML）**：\n- `Readiness: http-get http://:18081/ready delay=5s timeout=1s period=5s`\n- 探测目标是 **端口 18081**，路径 `/", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789388008689, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "c568668e54534321-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "c568668e54534321", "seq": 1359, "ts_ms": 1789388015318, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 41.039, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v16", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/c568668e54534321-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "9a6fde0186fea18ab7923aa7f9b2223fafc8f4bc4849102739695bba6c8c0288", "bytes": 2419}, "snapshot_sha256": "8bb754f43a0102c20805803a51e336da3b28e497cf07b67d52eb439962a39e15"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "c568668e54534321-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "c568668e54534321", "seq": 1360, "ts_ms": 1789388015318, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "c568668e54534321-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "c568668e54534321", "seq": 1361, "ts_ms": 1789388021062, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 5.743, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 915, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v16/workload` | NotReady | Readiness Probe 配置端口（18081）与容器实际监听端口（18080）不一致 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubelet | Readiness probe failed: Get \"http://172.16.104.33:18081/ready\": dial tcp 172.16.104.33:18081: connect: connection refused | 确认 Probe 配置端口 18081 的连接被拒绝 |\n| 2 | Logging | app container | listening on 18080 | 确认应用实际监听端口为 18080 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Pod conditions | ContainersReady=False, Ready=False | 确认 Pod 当前未就绪 |\n\n现有证据链闭环：日志 [2] 证明应用仅暴露 18080 端口，而 K8s Event [1] 显示探针持续向 18081 端口发起连接并失败，两者端口配置不一致直接导致了 [3] 中的未就绪状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nProbe 配置端口（18081）与容器监听端口（18080）不一致 → 健康检查请求无法到达应用 → 探针持续失败 → Pod Readiness 状态转为 False\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**配置端口不一致**（证据 [1]、[2]）。Kubelet 尝试访问未开放的 18081 端口导致连接拒绝，进而使 `app` 容器被标记为 `Unready`，导致 Pod 无法进入就绪状态。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v16/workload` | NotReady | Readiness Probe 配置端口（18081）与容器实际监听端口（18080）不一致 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubelet | Readiness probe failed: Get \"http://172.16.104.33:18081/ready\": dial tcp 172.16.104.33:18081: connect: connection refused | 确认 Probe 配置端口 18081 的连接被拒绝 |\n| 2 | Logging | app container | listening on 18080 | 确认应用实际监听端口为 18080 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Pod conditions | ContainersReady=False, Ready=False | 确认 Pod 当前未就绪 |\n\n现有证据链闭环：日志 [2] 证明应用仅暴露 18080 端口，而 K8s Event [1] 显示探针持续向 18081 端口发起连接并失败，两者端口配置不一致直接导致了 [3] 中的未就绪状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nProbe 配置端口（18081）与容器监听端口（18080）不一致 → 健康检查请求无法到达应用 → 探针持续失败 → Pod Readiness 状态转为 False\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**配置端口不一致**（证据 [1]、[2]）。Kubelet 尝试访问未开放的 18081 端口导致连接拒绝，进而使 `app` 容器被标记为 `Unready`，导致 Pod 无法进入就绪状态。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

